---
import { sitePath } from "../lib/url";
---

<section class="cta-banner" aria-labelledby="cta-banner-heading">
  <div class="site-wrap py-2xl lg:py-3xl">
    <h2 id="cta-banner-heading" class="type-h2">
      Let’s find out where AI can make a real difference in your business.
    </h2>
    <p class="type-body mt-md max-w-prose">
      Book a free 30-minute conversation with Dori to understand your business
      and discuss where AI could improve the way it operates.
    </p>
    <p class="type-body mt-md max-w-prose">
      You’ll get something tangible from the conversation. Within a few hours,
      we’ll send you a concise, high-level summary of the opportunities
      identified and a proposed plan for moving forward — at no additional
      charge.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-xl">
      <a class="btn-primary" href={sitePath("/book-call/")}>Book a Free Consultation</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
